@sprint2 @generative-document @ai
Feature: [Sprint 2] Generative Document dengan Asisten AI dan Biodata Tersimpan
  As a resident
  I want to describe my need in plain language and let the AI fill the application form
  So that I do not have to re-type my biodata every time I request a letter

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"
    And the resident has a new "DOM" application with "digital" signature

  Scenario: Draf surat dibuat otomatis dari template beserta biodata pemohon
    When the resident opens the application detail
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.draf_ai_konten" should contain "Karyawan Swasta"
    And the response field "data.draf_ai_konten" should contain "Surabaya"

  Scenario: Biodata pengajuan terakhir tersimpan, tujuan surat tidak ikut terbawa
    When the resident requests the last applicant data
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.pekerjaan" should be "Karyawan Swasta"
    And the response field "data.nomor_kk" should be "3578080101950001"
    And the response field "data.tujuan" should be null

  Scenario: Asisten AI mengisi jenis surat dan keperluan dari cerita warga
    Given the AI model will answer with:
      | field              | value                                       |
      | jenis_surat_kode   | SKCK                                        |
      | keperluan          | Persyaratan melamar pekerjaan di PT Maju Jaya |
      | tujuan             | Polrestabes Surabaya                        |
      | pertanyaan_lanjutan | Mau tanda tangan digital atau basah?        |
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "Saya mau bikin SKCK buat melamar kerja di PT Maju Jaya"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.ai_digunakan" should be true
    And the response field "data.jenis_surat.kode_surat" should be "SKCK"
    And the response field "data.keperluan" should be "Persyaratan melamar pekerjaan di PT Maju Jaya"
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.tujuan" should be "Polrestabes Surabaya"
    And the response field "data.sumber.tujuan" should be "ai"

  Scenario: Biodata yang tidak disebut warga diisi dari data tersimpan
    Given the AI model will answer with:
      | field            | value                 |
      | jenis_surat_kode | SKCK                  |
      | keperluan        | Melamar kerja         |
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "Saya mau SKCK untuk melamar kerja"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.pekerjaan" should be "Karyawan Swasta"
    And the response field "data.sumber.pekerjaan" should be "tersimpan"
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.agama" should be "Islam"
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.nomor_kk" should be "3578080101950001"
    And the response field "data.kurang" should be a list

  Scenario: Data sensitif tidak dikirim ke AI
    Given the AI model will answer with:
      | field            | value |
      | jenis_surat_kode | DOM   |
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "Saya butuh surat domisili, NIK saya 3578080101950001 nomor HP 081234567890"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the AI should have been called
    And the AI should not have received "3578080101950001"
    And the AI should not have received "081234567890"

  Scenario: Jawaban AI yang tidak valid diabaikan
    Given the AI model will answer with:
      | field            | value      |
      | jenis_surat_kode | TIDAKADA   |
      | jenis_kelamin    | Robot      |
      | tanggal_lahir    | 2999-01-01 |
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "Saya mau bikin surat yang aneh"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.jenis_surat" should be null
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.jenis_kelamin" should be "Laki-laki"
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.tanggal_lahir" should be "1995-08-17"

  Scenario: Formulir tetap terisi dari data tersimpan saat AI tidak tersedia
    Given the AI model is unavailable
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "Saya mau surat pengantar SKCK"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.ai_digunakan" should be false
    And the response field "data.data_pemohon.pekerjaan" should be "Karyawan Swasta"

  Scenario: Cerita yang terlalu pendek ditolak
    When the resident asks the AI assistant "SK"
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response field "error" should be "VALIDATION_ERROR"
